2026-10-22T17:16:29.7571975Z   pass  an empty liberties file is an error, not a silent pass
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7572239Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7572394Z test_liberties_cover_invented_form:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7572758Z   pass  an inferred form attribute with no claim is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7573279Z   pass  owning up to the geometry does not cover what the record says the building was
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7573771Z   pass  the error shows the form token that would fix it
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7574167Z   pass  claiming the form attribute satisfies the check
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7574598Z   pass  a documented form attribute is never required to be claimed
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7575052Z   pass  claiming an attribute that is not inferred is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7575301Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7575534Z test_geometry_declaration_is_required_for_unread_attributes:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7576033Z   pass  an attribute the archetype never reads must declare what the mesh does
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7576542Z   pass  an attribute the archetype does read needs no declaration
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7577040Z   pass  declaring geometry on an attribute the archetype builds is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7578119Z   pass  admitting to omitting a value the record says is false is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7578615Z   pass  a rejected reading declares record_only and passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7579257Z   pass  a geometry state outside the vocabulary is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7580129Z   pass  an archetype with no declared CONSUMED set is skipped, not indicted
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7580680Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7581032Z test_liberties_cover_omissions_and_simplifications:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7581666Z   pass  an attested feature the mesh omits with no liberty is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7582126Z   pass  a value a fixed default stands in for is an error too
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7582606Z   pass  the error says the model does not show what the record states
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7583063Z   pass  a rejected reading owes no admission
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7583545Z   pass  an attribute the archetype builds owes no admission
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7583978Z   pass  claiming both discharges them
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7584368Z   pass  claiming to have omitted something that is built is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7584896Z   pass  with no CONSUMED map the omission rule reports nothing rather than guessing
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7585387Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7585558Z test_liberties_cover_what_the_ground_invents:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7585954Z   pass  an inferred bank face with no liberty at all is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7586390Z   pass  an inferred swale with no liberty at all is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7586804Z   pass  the error quotes the token that would discharge it
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7587188Z   pass  a documented ground claim owes no admission
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7587868Z   pass  claiming both ground inventions satisfies the check
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7588350Z   pass  a claim against another epoch does not discharge this one's invention
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7588909Z   pass  and the claim against an epoch that is not committed is itself an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7589431Z   pass  claiming to have invented a documented ground claim is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7589911Z   pass  a resolved entry may keep a claim the evidence has settled
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7590355Z   pass  a claim on a block the spec does not grade is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7590821Z   pass  a ground admission does not cover a building's invented outline
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7591299Z   pass  and the ground's own claims stay discharged while it fails
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7591813Z   pass  with no terrain index the ground rule reports nothing rather than guessing
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7592258Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7592584Z test_the_checked_ground_is_the_ground_on_the_panel:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7593198Z   pass  the index is built off the compiler the panel renders from
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7593686Z   pass  a zone added to the spec is owed an admission the day it appears
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7594234Z   pass  and the gate demands it by name
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7594421Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7594642Z test_the_committed_ground_admits_to_everything_it_invents:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7595348Z   pass  the committed terrain states inventions a visitor walks on
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7595799Z   pass  and docs/LIBERTIES.md admits to every one of them
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7596068Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7596249Z test_archetypes_declare_what_they_consume:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7596690Z   pass  every params module declares a CONSUMED set
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7597054Z   pass  the shipped archetypes are covered
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7597689Z   pass  the sets name real parameters, not prose
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7597919Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7598129Z test_consumed_attributes_actually_reach_the_parameters:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7598603Z   pass  every consumed attribute the records state changes the parameters
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7599047Z   pass  the check had real attributes to exercise
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7599490Z   pass  an attribute the resolver ignores does not move the parameters
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7599903Z   pass  an attribute the resolver reads does
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7600104Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7600245Z test_covers_field_parses_to_claims:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7600622Z   pass  a two-segment token covers the structure, not one phase
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7601020Z   pass  a three-segment token names its phase
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7601362Z   pass  well-formed tokens report no problems
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7601742Z   pass  a form token keeps its prefix as part of the aspect
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7602152Z   pass  a form token without a phase covers the structure
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7602536Z   pass  well-formed form tokens report no problems
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7602989Z   pass  a terrain token parses into the terrain domain, not into a structure
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7603442Z   pass  a ground claim keeps the group its id carries
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7603813Z   pass  well-formed terrain tokens report no problems
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7604223Z   pass  both domains round-trip to the text the document wrote
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7604711Z   pass  a terrain token without an epoch is reported, not read as a structure
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7605156Z   pass  a terrain token naming no claim is reported
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7605669Z   pass  an aspect outside the vocabulary is reported
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7606008Z   pass  a bare structure id is reported
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7606392Z   pass  prose in a Covers field is reported, not silently parsed
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7606812Z   pass  a Covers field that claims nothing is reported
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7607030Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7607406Z test_mesh_input_hash_tracks_geometry_not_prose:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7607803Z   pass  rewriting a note does not make a mesh stale
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7608184Z   pass  a geometry declaration does not make a mesh stale
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7608588Z   pass  adding a source citation does not make a mesh stale
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7609000Z   pass  the phase's own prose does not make a mesh stale
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7609396Z   pass  a value the archetype reads makes the mesh stale
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7610029Z   pass  a confidence change makes the mesh stale, because it is shaded into the geometry
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7610775Z   pass  a redrawn footprint makes the mesh stale
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7611236Z   pass  renaming an attribute to the name the archetype reads is a rebuild
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7611689Z   pass  the derived properties are inside the hash
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7611908Z 
