2026-10-22T17:16:29.7613860Z   pass  a building on flat ground lands
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7614581Z   pass  a building whose far corner hangs over a drop does not land
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7615235Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7615930Z test_ground_contact_tolerance_is_the_step_up_rule:
