2026-10-22T17:16:29.7618253Z   pass  the same deck at bank height lands, and the water between is not counted
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7618563Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7618760Z test_ground_contact_declaration_is_checked_both_ways:
