2026-10-22T17:16:29.7621822Z   pass  claiming it satisfies the check
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7622188Z   pass  claiming a landing that is fine is an over-claim
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7622431Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7622659Z test_sidecar_shape_includes_only_indexed_structure_versions:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7623155Z   pass  a version-only emitted field joins the structure-sidecar contract
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7635458Z   pass  unlisted alternates and other derived documents cannot mask missing fields
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7636365Z   pass  removing the alternate's emitted field removes it from the contract
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7636936Z   pass  scenes without alternate versions retain their ordinary contract
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7637483Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7637854Z test_the_renderer_cannot_read_a_sidecar_field_the_compiler_never_writes:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7638376Z   pass  a field the compiler writes is read without complaint
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7638778Z   pass  a field no sidecar carries is caught
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7639185Z   pass  a name bound to a sidecar block is followed into its fields
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7639645Z   pass  resolution stops at a value rather than reading into it
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7640303Z   pass  reusing a name bound to a value cannot invent a missing field
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7640782Z   pass  a chain read straight off record.sidecar needs no binding
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7641368Z   pass  a field named in a comment is not a read of it
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7641965Z   pass  the scan still finds the renderer's real reads
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7642397Z   pass  the popup asks the sidecar whether the building was here
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7642840Z   pass  and no longer asks it whether the mesh is a placeholder
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7643098Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7643315Z test_the_ground_is_held_to_the_rules_a_record_answers_to:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7643691Z   pass  a cited documented claim passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7644075Z   pass  a citation that resolves in no source record is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7644792Z   pass  documented with no source is an error, as it is on a record
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7645630Z   pass  a land elevation claiming to be documented is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7646623Z   pass  inferred with no reasoning is an error, as it is on a record
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7647697Z   pass  inferred with reasoning passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7648111Z   pass  a zone nobody has heard of is checked the day it is added
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7648379Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7648587Z test_the_panel_shows_what_the_spec_grades:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7648925Z   pass  the committed spec yields claims
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7649345Z   pass  the water plane is documented and the bank face is not
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7649823Z   pass  a block that grades itself under another key is not dropped
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7650295Z   pass  a claim carries the spec's own figures and not its geometry
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7650927Z   pass  the compiled ground doc carries the spec's caveat verbatim
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7651426Z   pass  and the relief a visitor is told about is measured, not asserted
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7651712Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7651919Z test_writing_a_ground_claims_reasoning_costs_no_bake:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7652400Z   pass  the committed spec really does carry prose (else this proves nothing)
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7652874Z   pass  and none of it survives into the input document
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7653296Z   pass  the copy hashes the same as the epoch it was copied from
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7653773Z   pass  rewriting every note, caveat and citation in the spec changes it
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7654213Z   pass  ...and the ground does not go stale for it
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7654595Z   pass  nor for a note rewritten on a traced bank line
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7655006Z   pass  moving the bank face by a metre DOES stale the ground
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7655495Z   pass  and a zone nobody had heard of is a mesh input the day it is added
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7655934Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7656307Z test_the_ground_must_say_what_it_does_not_build:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7656914Z   pass  a stated figure the generator never reads, undeclared, is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7657802Z   pass  a figure the generator does read owes no declaration
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7658501Z   pass  and a declared one is accepted
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7659182Z   pass  a declaration outside the vocabulary is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7660122Z   pass  declaring an omission over a figure the ground IS built from is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7661160Z   pass  a graded block CONSUMED says nothing about is an error, not a pass
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7661451Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7661689Z test_an_unbuilt_ground_figure_owes_the_document_an_admission:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7662136Z   pass  a soil the ground is not made of, unclaimed, is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7662584Z   pass  a record_only figure owes the document nothing
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7662963Z   pass  claiming it satisfies the check
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7663403Z   pass  claiming a block that is neither invented nor unbuilt is still an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7663709Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7663871Z test_declared_terrain_reads_are_real_reads:
