2026-10-22T17:16:29.7670134Z test_a_prose_restatement_is_pinned_to_the_line_it_describes:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7670581Z   pass  the ease-out the spec describes is in the generator
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7670966Z   pass  a line that is not there is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7671387Z   pass  a phrase that lives only in a comment does not satisfy the scan
