2026-10-22T17:16:29.7673091Z test_a_placement_is_recomputed_from_its_control:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7673500Z   pass  a corner lot standing on both frontages passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7673898Z   pass  the same building 3 m off its frontage is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7674271Z   pass  a building rotated onto its lot passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7674901Z   pass  the unrotated origin at the same coordinate is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7675376Z   pass  coordinates with no derivation at all is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7676005Z   pass  not_derivable without a reason is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7676650Z   pass  not_derivable WITH a reason passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7677490Z   pass  a control that does not resolve is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7678446Z   pass  a kerb on the wrong axis of its street is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7679093Z   pass  control with no node ids and no stated gap is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7679483Z   pass  the same control saying so passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7679920Z   pass  node ids with no street names to re-derive the set from is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7680353Z   pass  node ids with no lat/lon is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7680697Z   pass  a deck landing on both traced banks passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7681060Z   pass  a deck a metre short of the bank is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7681505Z   pass  a variance from control that is not the declared one is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7681992Z   pass  a declared variance with nothing explaining it is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7682441Z   pass  a front wall on a skew street's corridor line passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7682925Z   pass  the same wall declaring a setback 2 m off what it measures is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7683467Z   pass  a house at the right distance with its BACK to the street is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7684133Z   pass  …and the same house declaring the wall that does face it passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7684671Z   pass  a frontage on a street the streets layer does not carry is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7685187Z   pass  a frontage on a street with no path to stand off is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7685657Z   pass  a compass direction is not one of the building's four walls
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7686199Z   pass  a frontage with no setback is an error — the setback is the claim
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7686790Z   pass  not_derivable carrying a frontage is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7687561Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7687960Z test_the_module_is_held_to_the_sheets_it_was_measured_off:
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7688631Z   pass  a measurement whose metres come out of its pixels passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7689075Z   pass  a width edited away from its own pixels is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7689672Z   pass  a summary that no longer matches its readings is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7690327Z   pass  a source the measurement cites and the repository does not have is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7691226Z   pass  a corridor with less open ground in it than a block face is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7692274Z   pass  a corridor committed without the reading that classified it is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7693316Z   pass  a corridor whose shorter boundary stops before a block face is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7694269Z   pass  a file that states no method cannot hold its corridors to one
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7694974Z   pass  a corridor named after the street its control lands on passes
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7695490Z   pass  a name whose offset does not come back out of the pixels is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7696026Z   pass  a name given to a corridor further off than the method allows is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7696577Z   pass  a corridor named after a street that runs ALONG the traverse is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7697104Z   pass  a name resting on control the repository does not have is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7698149Z   pass  a control point moved since it was measured is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7698713Z   pass  a datum exposure priced against a pixel that has moved is an error
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7699494Z   pass  a module the sheets exclude is an error even when the file is otherwise clean
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7699840Z 
2026-10-22T17:16:29.7700078Z test_the_ladder_is_read_from_the_schema_and_covers_every_rung:
