2026-10-22T17:16:31.0856212Z   ok    …it keeps its queue line
2026-10-22T17:16:31.0856384Z   ok    …and its mate is a group no longer
2026-10-22T17:16:31.0856713Z   ok    release refuses a ticket that is not claimed
